WEBVTT

00:36:57.810 --> 00:37:00.116
This episode was produced
by Jessica Glazer.

00:37:00.140 --> 00:37:01.836
Our show is mixed by Rick Kwan.

00:37:01.860 --> 00:37:05.016
Original music by Hahnsdale Hsu
and Allison Leyton-Brown.

00:37:05.040 --> 00:37:07.996
Ad stories produced by
Pineapple Street Studios.

00:37:08.020 --> 00:37:10.126
Special thanks to our sponsors,

00:37:10.150 --> 00:37:14.117
Accenture, BetterUp, Hilton and SAP.

00:37:14.840 --> 00:37:15.997
For their research,

00:37:16.021 --> 00:37:18.476
thanks to Patricia Hewlin
on facades of conformity;

00:37:18.500 --> 00:37:21.466
David Day and Deidra Schleicher
on self-monitoring;

00:37:21.490 --> 00:37:24.056
Elliot Aronson and colleagues
on the pratfall effect;

00:37:24.080 --> 00:37:26.956
Kerry Gibson and colleagues
on the risks of vulnerability;

00:37:26.980 --> 00:37:29.458
Dan Cable and Virginia Kay
on the double-edged sword

00:37:29.482 --> 00:37:30.726
of self-verification;